  "dct_description_sm": [
    "Relief shown pictorially, with hachures.; Oriented with north to the upper left.; Shows mountains, rivers, and vegetation, with pictorial representation of cities, towns, bridges, and fortresses. Includes numbers of houses in select villages and miscellaneous notes.; Cartouche: Two men lift draping fabric (one tying the end around the branch of a tree), next to a seated man holding the ring of a bag or other accessory, near a sword. Below and in front of the fabric are three putti: one on the back of a seated ram, a pair, at left, with one figure fishing, the other reclined next to an axe.",
